msgstr "CUDA 13.0"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:34
msgid ""
"You're all set! You can now start using LMCache. For hands-on guides and "
"more usage examples, see the :ref:`quickstart_examples` section."
msgstr "一切准备就绪！您现在可以开始使用 LMCache。有关实践指南和更多使用示例，请参阅 :ref:`quickstart_examples` 部分。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:39
msgid ""
"NIXL support (e.g. for disaggregated prefill and P2P KV sharing) is an "
"optional extra:"
msgstr "NIXL 支持（例如用于分离式 Prefill 和 P2P KV 共享）是一个可选的附加功能："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "CUDA 12.9"
msgstr "CUDA 12.9"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:48
msgid ""
"The CUDA 12.9 wheel is published to a dedicated `GitHub Release "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__ rather than PyPI. Each "
"release includes wheels for Linux x86_64 and ARM64."
msgstr "CUDA 12.9 的 wheel 发布在专用的 `GitHub Release <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__ 上，而不是 PyPI。每个发布版本包括适用于 Linux x86_64 和 ARM64 的 wheel。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:64
msgid ""
"``--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu129`` ensures the "
"CUDA 12.9 build of PyTorch is resolved. Without it, pip may select a "
"mismatched CUDA variant."
msgstr ""
"``--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu129`` 确保解析 PyTorch"
" 的 CUDA 12.9 构建。没有它，pip 可能会选择不匹配的 CUDA 变体。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "ROCm / torch 2.11"
msgstr "ROCm / torch 2.11"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:69
msgid ""
"The ROCm wheel targets AMD Instinct **gfx942** (MI300X / MI325X) and "
"**gfx950** (MI350X / MI355X) in one fat binary, and is ABI-matched to the"
" upstream ``vllm/vllm-openai-rocm`` image (torch 2.11, ROCm 7.2, Python "
"3.12). It is published to a dedicated `GitHub Release "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__ rather than PyPI."
msgstr "ROCm wheel 目标是 AMD Instinct **gfx942** (MI300X / MI325X) 和 **gfx950** (MI350X / MI355X) 的一个 fat binary，并且与上游的 ``vllm/vllm-openai-rocm`` 镜像 (torch 2.11, ROCm 7.2, Python 3.12) ABI 匹配。它发布在一个专用的 `GitHub Release <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__ 上，而不是 PyPI。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:75
msgid ""
"Install directly inside an upstream vLLM ROCm container — torch and the "
"ROCm runtime are already present, so ``--no-deps`` binds against them:"
msgstr "直接在上游 vLLM ROCm 容器内安装——torch 和 ROCm 运行时已经存在，因此 ``--no-deps`` 会绑定到它们："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:90
msgid ""
"The wheel excludes torch and the ROCm runtime libraries (they bind to the"
" host image at runtime). Match the wheel's minor torch/ROCm version to "
"your container; for other bases, use the **From Source** tab."
msgstr "该 wheel 排除了 torch 和 ROCm 运行时库（它们在运行时绑定到主机镜像）。将 wheel 的次要 torch/ROCm 版本与您的容器匹配；对于其他基础，使用 **从源代码构建** 选项卡。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The ROCm wheel carries a ``+rocm7.2`` PEP 440 local version, so ``pip "
"show lmcache`` reports which build is installed and the ROCm build can be"
" requested explicitly. A bare ``lmcache==${VERSION}`` also resolves it, "
"since ``==`` ignores the local segment."
msgstr "ROCm wheel 带有 ``+rocm7.2`` PEP 440 本地版本，因此 ``pip show lmcache`` 会报告安装了哪个构建，并且可以显式请求 ROCm 构建。一个简单的 ``lmcache==${VERSION}`` 也能解析它，因为 ``==`` 会忽略本地部分。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "Intel XPU"
msgstr "英特尔 XPU"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:103
msgid ""
"The Intel XPU wheel is ABI-matched to the upstream ``vllm/vllm-openai-"
"xpu:v0.26.0`` image (torch 2.12.0+xpu and oneAPI/SYCL). It is published "
"to a dedicated `GitHub Release "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__ rather than PyPI."
msgstr "英特尔 XPU 的 wheel 与上游 ``vllm/vllm-openai-xpu:v0.26.0`` 镜像（torch 2.12.0+xpu 和 oneAPI/SYCL）ABI 匹配。它被发布到专用的 `GitHub Release <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__ 而不是 PyPI。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:108
msgid ""
"Install directly inside the matching upstream vLLM XPU container. Torch "
"and the oneAPI/SYCL runtime are already present, so ``--no-deps`` "
"preserves that runtime stack:"
msgstr "直接在匹配的上游 vLLM XPU 容器内安装。Torch 和 oneAPI/SYCL 运行时已经存在，因此 ``--no-deps`` 可以保留该运行时栈："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:123
msgid ""
"The wheel excludes torch and oneAPI/SYCL runtime libraries, which bind to"
" the host image at runtime. Match the wheel's torch and oneAPI versions "
"to the container; for other bases, use the **From Source** tab."
msgstr "该 wheel 排除了 torch 和 oneAPI/SYCL 运行时库，这些库在运行时绑定到主机镜像。将 wheel 的 torch 和 oneAPI 版本与容器匹配；对于其他基础，使用 **从源代码构建** 选项卡。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:127
msgid ""
"``--no-index`` restricts pip to the GitHub Release asset, preventing it "
"from selecting a same-version CUDA wheel from PyPI."
msgstr "``--no-index`` 限制 pip 仅使用 GitHub Release 资产，防止其从 PyPI 选择相同版本的 CUDA wheel。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:132
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The XPU wheel carries a ``+xpu`` PEP 440 local version, so ``pip show "
"lmcache`` reports which build is installed and the XPU build can be "
"requested explicitly. A bare ``lmcache==${VERSION}`` also resolves it, "
"since ``==`` ignores the local segment."
msgstr ""
"XPU wheel 带有 ``+xpu`` PEP 440 本地版本，因此 ``pip show lmcache`` "
"会报告已安装的构建，并且可以显式请求 XPU 构建。一个简单的 ``lmcache==${VERSION}`` 也能解析它，因为 ``==`` "
"会忽略本地部分。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "Moore Threads MUSA"
msgstr "Moore Threads MUSA"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:139
msgid ""
"The MUSA wheel is built in the validated TorchMUSA/MUSA SDK image used by"
" the release workflow and is published to a dedicated `GitHub Release "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__. It is not uploaded to "
"PyPI because TorchMUSA is distributed by Moore Threads rather than the "
"public PyPI index."
msgstr ""
"MUSA wheel 是在发布工作流中使用的经过验证的 TorchMUSA/MUSA SDK 镜像中构建的，并发布到专用的 `GitHub "
"Release <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/releases>`__。它没有上传到 PyPI，因为 "
"TorchMUSA 是由 Moore Threads 分发的，而不是公共 PyPI 索引。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:145
msgid ""
"Start a matching MUSA runtime image. The image must provide "
"``torch_musa``, the MUSA SDK libraries, and (for the native transfer fast"
" path) ``musa_aiter``:"
msgstr ""
"启动匹配的 MUSA 运行时镜像。该镜像必须提供 ``torch_musa``、MUSA SDK "
"库，以及（用于本地传输快速路径）``musa_aiter``："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:163
msgid ""
"``--no-deps`` is required: it preserves the image's vendor-pinned "
"TorchMUSA stack instead of resolving the generic ``torch`` dependency "
"from PyPI. ``--no-index`` prevents pip from selecting a same-version CUDA"
" wheel."
msgstr ""
"``--no-deps`` 是必需的：它保留了图像的供应商固定的 TorchMUSA 堆栈，而不是从 PyPI 解析通用的 ``torch`` "
"依赖项。``--no-index`` 防止 pip 选择相同版本的 CUDA wheel。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:168
msgid ""
"The current MUSA profile ships LMCache's Python MUSA integration and "
"common native modules. MUSA-specific fused kernels remain supplied by the"
" optional ``musa_aiter`` package; build from source if your vendor image "
"uses a different native extension."
msgstr ""
"当前的 MUSA 配置包含 LMCache 的 Python MUSA 集成和常见的本地模块。特定于 MUSA 的融合内核仍由可选的 "
"``musa_aiter`` 包提供；如果您的供应商镜像使用不同的本地扩展，请从源代码构建。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:176
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The wheel carries a ``+musa`` PEP 440 local version, so ``pip show "
"lmcache`` identifies the accelerator variant. A bare "
"``lmcache==${VERSION}`` also matches this wheel, but the explicit local "
"version avoids accidentally selecting the CUDA artifact."
msgstr ""
"该 wheel 带有 ``+musa`` PEP 440 本地版本，因此 ``pip show lmcache`` 可以识别加速器变体。一个简单的"
" ``lmcache==${VERSION}`` 也可以匹配这个 wheel，但显式的本地版本可以避免意外选择 CUDA 工件。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "ROCm 7.2.4 / torch 2.10"
msgstr "ROCm 7.2.4 / torch 2.10"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:184
msgid ""
"This wheel targets AMD Instinct **gfx942** (MI300X / MI325X) and "
"**gfx950** (MI350X / MI355X). It is built and smoke-tested in the public "
"AMD PyTorch image "
"``rocm/pytorch:rocm7.2.4_ubuntu24.04_py3.12_pytorch_release_2.10.0`` "
"pinned at digest "
"``sha256:4449f856653602317e4101a76fce599c7fcd58ccec2e539951fce5f73083179e``."
" It does not require the ATOM image."
msgstr ""
"此轮子针对 AMD Instinct **gfx942** (MI300X / MI325X) 和 **gfx950** (MI350X / "
"MI355X)。它是在公共的 AMD PyTorch 镜像 "
"``rocm/pytorch:rocm7.2.4_ubuntu24.04_py3.12_pytorch_release_2.10.0`` "
"中构建并经过烟雾测试，固定在摘要 "
"``sha256:4449f856653602317e4101a76fce599c7fcd58ccec2e539951fce5f73083179e``。它不需要"
" ATOM 镜像。"

