"`torch-2.10.0+rocm7.2.4.lw.git3d3aa833-cp312-cp312-linux_x86_64.whl "
"<https://repo.radeon.com/rocm/manylinux/rocm-"
"rel-7.2.4/torch-2.10.0%2Brocm7.2.4.lw.git3d3aa833-cp312-cp312-linux_x86_64.whl>`__"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:197
msgid ""
"torch runtime version: ``2.10.0+rocm7.2.4.git3d3aa833`` (git "
"``3d3aa833db84eed6b7f5595cb5f162c2f78300a4``)"
msgstr ""
"torch 运行时版本: ``2.10.0+rocm7.2.4.git3d3aa833`` (git "
"``3d3aa833db84eed6b7f5595cb5f162c2f78300a4``)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:199
msgid "ROCm ``7.2.4`` with HIP runtime ``7.2.53211``"
msgstr "ROCm ``7.2.4`` 与 HIP 运行时 ``7.2.53211``"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:200
msgid "Python/platform tag: ``cp312-cp312-manylinux_2_39_x86_64``"
msgstr "Python/platform tag: ``cp312-cp312-manylinux_2_39_x86_64``"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:201
msgid "C++ ABI: ``_GLIBCXX_USE_CXX11_ABI=1``"
msgstr "C++ ABI: ``_GLIBCXX_USE_CXX11_ABI=1``"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:203
msgid "Install the matching wheel inside that pinned image:"
msgstr "在该固定镜像中安装匹配的 wheel："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:218
msgid ""
"The wheel links torch and ROCm libraries from the container at runtime. "
"Other torch 2.10, ROCm 7.2.x, Python, or C++ ABI combinations are not "
"covered by this artifact; build from source for those environments."
msgstr ""
"该 wheel 在运行时从容器中链接 torch 和 ROCm 库。其他 torch 2.10、ROCm 7.2.x、Python 或 C++ "
"ABI 组合不在此工件的覆盖范围内；对于这些环境，请从源代码构建。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "Nightly"
msgstr "每日构建版"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:224
msgid ""
"Nightly wheels are built from the latest ``dev`` branch each day at 07:30"
" UTC and published to GitHub Releases. No version pinning required — "
"``--pre`` picks the latest nightly automatically."
msgstr ""
"每日构建版 wheel 包每天 UTC 时间 07:30 从最新的 ``dev`` 分支构建并发布到 GitHub Releases。无需锁定版本"
" — ``--pre`` 会自动选取最新的每日构建版。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "ROCm 7.2"
msgstr "ROCm 7.2"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:254
msgid ""
"Run inside an upstream vLLM ROCm container so torch and the ROCm runtime "
"are already present, then install with ``--no-deps``:"
msgstr "在上游 vLLM ROCm 容器中运行，以便 torch 和 ROCm 运行时已经存在，然后使用 ``--no-deps`` 安装："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:266
msgid ""
"Nightly ROCm wheels are versioned like the CUDA nightlies with the ROCm "
"local segment appended, e.g. ``0.5.4.dev15+rocm7.2``."
msgstr ""
"每日构建版 ROCm wheel 的版本命名方式与 CUDA 每日构建版相同，后面附加 ROCm 本地段，例如 "
"``0.5.4.dev15+rocm7.2``。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:271
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``--no-index`` is required here. ``--find-links`` only *adds* a source, "
"so without it pip also considers PyPI — and under PEP 440 a pre-release "
"such as ``0.5.4rc4`` outranks ``0.5.4.dev15+rocm7.2``, so ``--pre`` would"
" install the CUDA wheel instead. The stable tab does not need it because "
"``lmcache==${VERSION}+rocm7.2`` is an exact pin that only the ROCm "
"release can satisfy. ``--no-deps`` is what makes ``--no-index`` safe "
"here: torch and the ROCm runtime come from the container, so nothing else"
" needs resolving."
msgstr ""
"``--no-index`` 在这里是必需的。 ``--find-links`` 仅仅 *添加* 一个源，因此如果没有它，pip 也会考虑 "
"PyPI — 根据 PEP 440，像 ``0.5.4rc4`` 这样的预发布版本会优先于 ``0.5.4.dev15+rocm7.2``，因此 "
"``--pre`` 会安装 CUDA wheel。稳定版选项不需要它，因为 ``lmcache==${VERSION}+rocm7.2`` "
"是一个精确的固定版本，只有 ROCm 版本可以满足。 ``--no-deps`` 使得 ``--no-index`` 在这里是安全的：torch "
"和 ROCm 运行时来自容器，因此不需要解析其他内容。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "From Source"
msgstr "从源代码安装"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:282
msgid ""
"``--no-build-isolation`` ensures the kernels are compiled against the "
"same torch already installed in your environment, preventing undefined "
"symbol errors at runtime."
msgstr "``--no-build-isolation`` 确保内核与您环境中已安装的相同 torch 进行编译，从而防止运行时出现未定义符号错误。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "ROCm"
msgstr "ROCm"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "MetaX MACA"
msgstr "MetaX MACA"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:368
msgid ""
"MACA is CUDA-compatible: a MACA-enabled torch build reports ``device.type"
" == \"cuda\"``, so LMCache's existing CUDA-compatible connector path "
"works without a separate device backend. There is no prebuilt MACA wheel "
"or CI build -- this is a self-compile-only path, built with a MACA-"
"enabled torch already installed via MetaX's own toolchain (not from "
"PyPI)."
msgstr ""
"MACA 兼容 CUDA：启用 MACA 的 torch 构建报告 ``device.type == \\\"cuda\\\"``，因此 "
"LMCache 现有的 CUDA 兼容连接器路径可以在没有单独设备后端的情况下工作。没有预构建的 MACA wheel 或 CI "
"构建——这是一个仅限自编译的路径，使用通过 MetaX 自己的工具链安装的启用 MACA 的 torch 构建（不是来自 PyPI）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:465
msgid "See :ref:`docker_deployment` for running the container and ROCm images."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`docker_deployment` 以获取运行容器和 ROCm 镜像的信息。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst
msgid "CLI Only"
msgstr "仅限 CLI"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:469
msgid ""
"Lightweight CLI-only package for querying or benchmarking a remote "
"LMCache server. No CUDA required, works on any OS."
msgstr "轻量级纯 CLI 软件包，用于查询或对远程 LMCache 服务器进行基准测试。无需 CUDA，支持任意操作系统。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:478
msgid ""
"``lmcache-cli`` and ``lmcache`` ship the same ``lmcache`` CLI command. Do"
" not install both in the same environment."
msgstr "``lmcache-cli`` 和 ``lmcache`` 提供相同的 ``lmcache`` CLI 命令。请勿在同一环境中同时安装两者。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:482
msgid "Build the Docker Image"
msgstr "构建 Docker 镜像"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:484
msgid ""
"Instead of pulling a prebuilt image, you can build the LMCache "
"(integrated with vLLM) image yourself from the provided Dockerfile, "
"located in `docker/ "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/docker>`_."
msgstr ""
"您也可以不拉取预构建镜像，而是直接使用仓库中提供的 Dockerfile 自行构建 LMCache（集成 vLLM）镜像，Dockerfile "
"位于 `docker/ <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/docker>`_。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:488
msgid "From the root of the LMCache repository:"
msgstr "在 LMCache 仓库的根目录下："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:494
msgid ""
"Replace ``<IMAGE_NAME>`` and ``<TAG>`` with your desired image name and "
"tag. See the example build file in `docker/ "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/docker>`_ for an explanation"
" of all build arguments."
msgstr ""
"将 ``<IMAGE_NAME>`` 和 ``<TAG>`` 替换为所需的镜像名称和标签。各构建参数的说明请参阅 `docker/ "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/docker>`_ 中的示例构建文件。"

